{"3566310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gooblings", "steam_appid": 3566310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line into a living pond where every creature is procedurally generated from hundreds of species, color palettes, patterns, and mutations. No two fish are the same — not across your game, not across anyone's.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/5edaef9de0a9e5a7939d7213ff337530.poster.avif?t=1776400052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/5edaef9de0a9e5a7939d7213ff337530.webm?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/5edaef9de0a9e5a7939d7213ff337530.mp4?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hat-wearing oddballs, glowing deep-water rares, and winged legendaries that spawn once and never again. Build a collection that proves you were there first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural fish genetics - species, colors, patterns, and mutations combine into millions of possible creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Breed your catches to chase specific traits or stumble into something new</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fill and decorate personal aquariums to show off your rarest finds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fish the same pond with friends in real-time multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your sailboat with the colors and patterns of your favorite fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive dynamic events - volcanoes turn the water red and change what’s biting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade on a live marketplace and see who pulls the rarest catch of the day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/bb7747396956cf24a18e943e557a73fd.poster.avif?t=1776400052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/bb7747396956cf24a18e943e557a73fd.webm?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/bb7747396956cf24a18e943e557a73fd.mp4?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/c25c8b0b3f6a503638609bc6c0905771.poster.avif?t=1776400052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/c25c8b0b3f6a503638609bc6c0905771.webm?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/c25c8b0b3f6a503638609bc6c0905771.mp4?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/8d3e1c226d5f591f6ebc0042e6cd194d.poster.avif?t=1776400052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566310/extras/8d3e1c226d5f591f6ebc0042e6cd194d.webm?t=1776400052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"